{User Notes}
DO NOT LOOK AT THE CHARACTER INFO, GALLERY, OR SHARED CHATS below if you want to play this card in the way it was intended to be experienced. Or do, I don't really care. I ain't your momma.

{Luigi's Creator Corner}
So this is more of a light "proof of concept" type card more than anything. I wanted to see if I could make a bot where the character's entire identity can be randomized at the start each time, picking from random "variations" each time you start a new chat with them. In my testing, it seemed to work well enough. Didn't spend TOO long on this one, and the concept is fairly light, so I doubt there's much substance here. But I hope you have a blast anyways!
